{"artifact_id": "PRO-04", "chunk_id": "PRO-04:sec:EVIDENCE_SOURCE_BASIS", "content_sha256": "82aeb622b504089bd6ec87e9aade2b8b74ec88c3aa308abf72c250c11fbbe9c2", "heading": "Evidence / Source Basis", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "PRO-04", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-006", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "3b6a443d4e3643f461a1cca12c6e1ad47ab6b596", "syllabai_resources": "8b5a64f1b18724208ff19969b002028d3ed41bed"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "problem_solving_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": true, "supplementary": false, "textbook": true}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Evidence / Source Basis\n\nPrimary evidence: SRC-QPMS-4CH1 (2019-06 Paper 1C mark-scheme forks with paper\nidentity preserved via the pack file path) and SRC-BOOK-4CH1-SB1 (decision-rule\nchunk at line+chunk-id locator). Supplementary: SRC-SPEC-4CH1 command-word\nappendix page. Bounded excerpts with locators preserved; caps enforced by the\npack builder."}
{"artifact_id": "PRO-04", "chunk_id": "PRO-04:sec:LIMITATIONS_COVERAGE_GAPS", "content_sha256": "8119f92206ae351f3a064b1451050d3fee022a9c4beda9a823d84df52d5e605c", "heading": "Limitations / Coverage Gaps", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "PRO-04", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-006", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "3b6a443d4e3643f461a1cca12c6e1ad47ab6b596", "syllabai_resources": "8b5a64f1b18724208ff19969b002028d3ed41bed"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "problem_solving_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": true, "supplementary": false, "textbook": true}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Limitations / Coverage Gaps\n\nDecision forks are catalogued from this pack's excerpt windows for one paper;\nother sessions' fork structures are neither enumerated nor denied. Mark-scheme\nforks are cited as published decision statements only; the MS family owns the\nsystematic mark-layer analysis, and no mark_points plane data is consumed or\nwritten. No examiner sentiment is synthesized from mark schemes. OCR-era\nquirks are quoted as parsed or paraphrased, never repaired. No canonical planes\nwere written."}
